      "text": "\ndotnet test - run only type=Unit SUPER FAST - \ndotnet test - run only type=UnitIntegration - slower because they MIGHT touch networks,etc (that was what we had before with the test double)\n\ndotnet test (run the tests) - run only type=SystemTest\n",
