      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Twelve Factor App - THAT is an App \n    - you call them a system\n    - it does NOT mean one assembly, etc.\n    - it is one unit of testing and deployment.\n\n.NEt Affected\n    - this is a task you can run in ADO or Github actions\n    - It will only run the tests and do the build etc. of what was affected by that last PR, etc.\n",
